The options
:ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.kubernetes.kubeadm.extraClusterConfiguration`,
:ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.kubernetes.kubeadm.extraInitConfiguration`
and :ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.kubernetes.kubeadm.extraJoinConfiguration`
have been added to allow for more flexible configuration of kubeadm.
They are merged into the configuration that Tarook generates.
